# Implementation Plan - UI/UX Modernization & Enhancements

## Goal
Transform the current functional calculator into a premium, modern tool with enhanced usability features:
1.  **Unified View**: Calculator and Data Table on the same page.
2.  **Smart Defaults**: Auto-fill NCV and EF based on fuel type selection.
3.  **Unit Conversion**: Allow users to input in various units (kg, lbs, MWh, etc.) while standardizing for the backend (Tonnes, TJ).
4.  **Modern Aesthetics**: Improved spacing, cards, and visual hierarchy.

## User Actions
> [!NOTE]
> No backend changes are required for this phase. All logic will be handled client-side before submission.

